      </div>

      <div class="workspace-banner-copy">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Coach-safe route workspace</p>
        <h2>Plan, verify and approve the complete journey.</h2>
        <p>Search addresses, confirm draggable map pins, add ordered stops and review coach restrictions before assignment.</p>
      </div>
      </div>
      <div class="planner-intro-badges">
        <span>Verified pins</span>
        <span>Multiple stops</span>
        <span>Coach profile</span>
